cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EvoNexus, please cite it and cite the underlying public datasets separately."
title: "EvoNexus: evolutionary and ecological networks of viral host sharing"
abstract: >-
  A provenance-aware Nextflow DSL2 pipeline for Bayesian inference of
  habitat-associated viral RNA detection and cross-host connectivity from
  public bat metatranscriptomic datasets, with automated manuscript outputs.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-08"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/aglucaci/evonexus"
